flowchart TD
  start[coscientist start<br/>goal, rubric, max_hypotheses,<br/>step_budget, seed] --> gen[Generate hypotheses]
  gen --> dup{Duplicate gate<br/>lexical or cosine}
  dup -->|near-duplicate| drop[Discard with similarity]
  dup -->|novel| review[Five-stage review<br/>initial → full → deep verification<br/>→ simulation → observation]
  review -->|fail| reject[Rejected]
  review -->|pass| pool[Active pool]

  pool --> next[coscientist next or<br/>coscientist_rank propose]
  next --> match[Pairwise match<br/>both presentation orders]
  match --> rate[Glicko-2 update<br/>rating, RD, volatility]
  rate --> stop{Stop?<br/>budget, plateau,<br/>no competitors, match cap}
  stop -->|no| next
  stop -->|yes| export[Export ranked shortlist<br/>Markdown, JSON, or Mermaid]

  pool --> evolve[Evolve or feedback]
  evolve --> gen

  classDef step fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
  classDef gate fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#6366f1,color:#312e81
  classDef stop fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#f97316,color:#7c2d12
  class start,gen,review,pool,next,match,rate,evolve step
  class dup,stop gate
  class drop,reject,export stop
